-- KATHMANDU VALLEY CULTURAL DAY TOUR
('Kathmandu Valley Cultural Day Tour','kathmandu-valley-day-tour','A guided tour of Kathmandu''s UNESCO World Heritage Sites including temples, stupas, and durbar squares.','Explore the cultural heart of Nepal on this comprehensive day tour of the Kathmandu Valley. Led by a licensed cultural guide, you''ll visit the most iconic UNESCO World Heritage Sites including Swayambhunath Stupa (Monkey Temple), Boudhanath Stupa (one of the largest in the world), Pashupatinath Temple (the holiest Hindu temple), and Kathmandu Durbar Square with its ancient palaces and the Living Goddess Kumari. This tour offers a deep dive into Nepal''s rich history, art, architecture, and living traditions.','https://images.pexels.com/photos/3389536/pexels-photo-3389536.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1600','1 Day','Easy','$89','Tour',50,
'[{"day":1,"title":"Kathmandu Valley Heritage Tour","description":"Hotel pickup at 8 AM. Visit Swayambhunath Stupa for panoramic valley views. Continue to Boudhanath Stupa, the largest stupa in Nepal. Visit Pashupatinath Temple on the Bagmati River. Afternoon: explore Kathmandu Durbar Square, visit the Living Goddess Kumari. Return to hotel by 4 PM."}]'::jsonb,
'["Hotel pickup and drop-off","Private air-conditioned vehicle","English-speaking cultural guide","All entry fees to heritage sites","Bottled water","Government taxes"]'::jsonb,
'["Lunch","Personal expenses","Tips for guide and driver"]'::jsonb,
'["Visit Swayambhunath Stupa (Monkey Temple)","Explore Boudhanath Stupa — one of largest in world","Visit the holy Pashupatinath Temple","See the Living Goddess Kumari at Durbar Square","Comprehensive cultural tour in one day"]'::jsonb),

-- CHISAPANI NAGARKOT HIKE
('Chisapani Nagarkot Hike','chisapani-nagarkot-hike','A short hiking adventure from Kathmandu through Shivapuri National Park to the sunrise viewpoints of Nagarkot.','This 3-day hiking tour is perfect for those who want a quick escape from Kathmandu into nature. Starting from Sundarijal, you''ll hike through Shivapuri National Park to Chisapani, a beautiful hill station with panoramic mountain views. On the second day, you''ll hike through forests and traditional villages to Nagarkot, famous for its sunrise views over the Himalayas. On a clear day, you can see Mount Everest from the viewpoint.','https://images.pexels.com/photos/2901209/pexels-photo-2901209.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1600','3 Days','Easy','$199','Tour',51,
'[{"day":1,"title":"Sundarijal to Chisapani","description":"Drive to Sundarijal. 4-5 hour hike through Shivapuri National Park to Chisapani (2,300m). Evening mountain views."},{"day":2,"title":"Chisapani to Nagarkot","description":"6-7 hour hike through forests and villages to Nagarkot (2,175m). Sunset over the Himalayas."},{"day":3,"title":"Nagarkot Sunrise & Return","description":"Early sunrise view from the Nagarkot tower. Drive back to Kathmandu."}]'::jsonb,
'["Hotel pickup and drop-off","English-speaking guide","Entry to Shivapuri National Park","2 nights teahouse accommodation","All meals on hike (2 breakfasts, 2 lunches, 2 dinners)"]'::jsonb,
'["Personal expenses","Travel insurance","Tips"]'::jsonb,
'["Hike through Shivapuri National Park","Panoramic Himalayan views from Chisapani and Nagarkot","Sunrise over Everest on clear days","Traditional Tamang villages along the trail","Quick escape from Kathmandu into nature"]'::jsonb),

-- LUXURY POKHARA TOUR
('Pokhara Tour','pokhara-tour','A relaxing 3-day tour of Pokhara with lakeside luxury, Himalayan views, and adventure activities.','Pokhara is Nepal''s adventure capital and most beautiful lakeside city. This 3-day luxury tour includes comfortable boutique accommodation, a guided city tour covering Devi''s Falls, Gupteshwor Cave, the International Mountain Museum, and the World Peace Pagoda. You''ll enjoy a sunrise trip to Sarangkot for panoramic Annapurna views, a boat ride on Phewa Lake, and optional adventure activities like paragliding or zip-lining. With private transport and expert guides, this is the perfect way to experience Pokhara in comfort.','https://images.pexels.com/photos/2356045/pexels-photo-2356045.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1600','3 Days','Easy','$349','Tour',52,
'[{"day":1,"title":"Drive to Pokhara & Lakeside Evening","description":"6-hour drive from Kathmandu or 25-minute flight. Check into lakeside hotel. Evening boat ride on Phewa Lake."},{"day":2,"title":"Sarangkot Sunrise & City Tour","description":"Pre-dawn trip to Sarangkot for sunrise. Visit Devi''s Falls, Gupteshwor Cave, and Mountain Museum."},{"day":3,"title":"World Peace Pagoda & Return","description":"Morning hike to World Peace Pagoda. View of the Annapurna range. Drive back to Kathmandu."}]'::jsonb,
'["Hotel pickup and drop-off","Round-trip tourist bus","2 nights Pokhara hotel (BB basis)","English-speaking guide","Sarangkot sunrise transfer","All entry fees"]'::jsonb,
'["Paragliding (optional)","Lunch and dinner","Personal expenses","Tips"]'::jsonb,
'["Phewa Lake views with Annapurna reflection","Sarangkot sunrise panorama","World Peace Pagoda hike","Explore Devi''s Falls and Gupteshwor Cave","Optional paragliding and adventure activities"]'::jsonb),

-- CHITWAN TOUR 3 DAYS
('Chitwan National Park Tour','chitwan-national-park-tour','A jungle safari adventure in Nepal''s premier national park with rhinos, tigers, and Tharu culture.','Chitwan National Park, a UNESCO World Heritage Site, is Nepal''s most famous wildlife reserve. This 3-day safari takes you deep into the jungle with expert naturalist guides. You''ll explore on elephant-back, in dugout canoes, and on foot. Spot one-horned rhinoceros, Bengal tigers, leopards, sloth bears, and over 500 species of birds. You''ll also visit a traditional Tharu village and enjoy a cultural dance performance. With comfortable jungle lodge accommodation, this is the perfect wildlife adventure.','https://images.pexels.com/photos/2433970/pexels-photo-2433970.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1600','3 Days','Easy','$399','Tour',53,
'[{"day":1,"title":"Drive to Chitwan & Tharu Village","description":"5-hour drive to Chitwan. Check into jungle lodge. Evening Tharu village walk and cultural dance."},{"day":2,"title":"Jungle Safari & Canoeing","description":"Elephant-back safari at dawn. Afternoon dugout canoe ride on the Rapti River. Nature walk. Crocodile spotting."},{"day":3,"title":"Birdwatching & Return","description":"Early birdwatching walk. Visit elephant breeding center. Drive back to Kathmandu."}]'::jsonb,
'["Hotel pickup and drop-off","Private round-trip transport","2 nights jungle lodge (full board)","English-speaking naturalist guide","Elephant-back safari","Dugout canoe ride","Chitwan National Park entry fee"]'::jsonb,
'["Travel insurance","Personal expenses","Tips","Alcoholic drinks"]'::jsonb,
'["Track one-horned rhinos on elephant-back","Search for the elusive Bengal tiger","Canoe alongside crocodiles","Tharu cultural dance performance","Over 500 species of birds"]'::jsonb)

) AS v(title, slug, description, long_description, image_url, duration, difficulty, price, category, sort_order, itinerary, includes, excludes, highlights)
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM public.adventures WHERE slug = v.slug);


